    <subfield code="a">Outwardly the book appears to be a simple stapled single-fold pamphlet. Inside the book, a small accordion-folded leaf is attached, extending from the verso of the second page to the recto of the penultimate page of the pamphlet.  Each page has a rectangular opening cut in it to allow the accordion-folded leaf through, so that the accordion can operate independently from the larger book's pages. -- JH.</subfield>
